@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. 创建三道选择题，总分 20；本文件不会调用 DeepSeek
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/exams
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "里程碑 C 成绩汇总验收",
  "questions": [
    {
      "questionNo": 1,
      "questionType": "CHOICE",
      "content": "第一题",
      "maxScore": 5,
      "referenceAnswer": "A"
    },
    {
      "questionNo": 2,
      "questionType": "CHOICE",
      "content": "第二题",
      "maxScore": 10,
      "referenceAnswer": "B"
    },
    {
      "questionNo": 3,
      "questionType": "CHOICE",
      "content": "第三题",
      "maxScore": 5,
      "referenceAnswer": "C"
    }
  ]
}

> {%
  client.global.set("summaryExamId", response.body.id);
  client.global.set("summaryQuestion1", response.body.questions[0].id);
  client.global.set("summaryQuestion2", response.body.questions[1].id);
  client.global.set("summaryQuestion3", response.body.questions[2].id);
%}

### 2. 创建完整答卷
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/exams/{{summaryExamId}}/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentNo": "summary-{{$random.uuid}}",
  "studentName": "成绩汇总验收学生",
  "answers": [
    {"questionId": {{summaryQuestion1}}, "answerText": "A"},
    {"questionId": {{summaryQuestion2}}, "answerText": "B"},
    {"questionId": {{summaryQuestion3}}, "answerText": "C"}
  ]
}

> {% client.global.set("summarySubmissionId", response.body.id); %}

### 3. 评分前查询；预期 INCOMPLETE、gradingResultCount=0、finalScore=null
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions/{{summarySubmissionId}}/summary

### 4. 自动评分并保存三个结果；仍不得把建议分当成正式分
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions/{{summarySubmissionId}}/grading

> {%
  client.global.set("summaryResult1", response.body.results[0].id);
  client.global.set("summaryVersion1", response.body.results[0].version);
  client.global.set("summaryResult2", response.body.results[1].id);
  client.global.set("summaryVersion2", response.body.results[1].version);
  client.global.set("summaryResult3", response.body.results[2].id);
  client.global.set("summaryVersion3", response.body.results[2].version);
%}

### 5. 建议分已存在但尚未审核；预期 confirmedScore=0、finalScore=null
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions/{{summarySubmissionId}}/summary

### 6. 第一题确认 5 分
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/grading/results/{{summaryResult1}}/review
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "SET_SCORE",
  "actualScore": 5,
  "expectedVersion": {{summaryVersion1}}
}

### 7. 第二题确认 8 分，并保存后续改分所需的新版本
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/grading/results/{{summaryResult2}}/review
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "SET_SCORE",
  "actualScore": 8,
  "expectedVersion": {{summaryVersion2}}
}

> {% client.global.set("summaryReviewedVersion2", response.body.version); %}

### 8. 部分审核汇总；预期 confirmedScore=13、INCOMPLETE、finalScore=null
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions/{{summarySubmissionId}}/summary

### 9. 第三题确认 4 分
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/grading/results/{{summaryResult3}}/review
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "SET_SCORE",
  "actualScore": 4,
  "expectedVersion": {{summaryVersion3}}
}

### 10. 全部审核汇总；预期 confirmedScore=17、COMPLETE、finalScore=17
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions/{{summarySubmissionId}}/summary

### 11. 将第二题从 8 分修改为 7 分
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/grading/results/{{summaryResult2}}/review
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "SET_SCORE",
  "actualScore": 7,
  "expectedVersion": {{summaryReviewedVersion2}}
}

### 12. 实时汇总应更新为 confirmedScore=16、finalScore=16
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions/{{summarySubmissionId}}/summary

### 13. 无数据变化时重复查询；结果应与第 12 步一致
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions/{{summarySubmissionId}}/summary

### 14. 完全重启 Spring Boot 后再次查询；结果仍应为 COMPLETE、finalScore=16
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/submissions/{{summarySubmissionId}}/summary
